  "notes": "Poznote settings. Distinctive: each setting row = small light-blue square icon tile + label + right-aligned value (colored pill in Bootstrap-alert green/red, or native select) + faint (?) help and pin icons. Uppercase letter-spaced grey group labels (PROFILE & SIGN-IN) sit above white 12px-radius cards with 1px #e0e0e0 borders and hairline row dividers. Active nav item uses light-blue fill with #007db8 text. Rows are click targets opening modal dialogs. Filter field turns the page into a single long list of all matching sections. 'Pin to top' per row (proposed as new discovery value). Content column is centered and narrow (~650px) leaving much empty background."
